{"3454540": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Whitematter", "steam_appid": 3454540, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Down becomes up - shift your direction of gravity to the walls and ceiling in this first-person 3D puzzle platformer. Solve 40+ challenging room-based puzzles that flex your spatial reasoning skills, rather than precise timing. Compete with others on the leaderboard, or take it slow and steady - the choice is yours.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step on Shift Pads to <strong>change your direction of gravity</strong>, offering a unique way to traverse your environment. Use your newfound freedom to access new areas and interact with the rooms from a truly unique perspective.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3454540/extras/75fabaabe6eee1f3241847bb203ab619.poster.avif?t=1788036856\" aria-label=\"Change gravity\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3454540/extras/75fabaabe6eee1f3241847bb203ab619.webm?t=1788036856\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3454540/extras/75fabaabe6eee1f3241847bb203ab619.mp4?t=1788036856\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enable the <strong>AR overlay</strong> to view device connections and gain valuable insight into the room layout. Use this information to try out different strategies and plan your approach.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3454540/extras/758607869f4498e6f32f7353b4c4f48a.poster.avif?t=1788036856\" aria-label=\"Plan your approach\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3454540/extras/758607869f4498e6f32f7353b4c4f48a.webm?t=1788036856\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3454540/extras/758607869f4498e6f32f7353b4c4f48a.mp4?t=1788036856\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilize a variety of different <strong>devices and mechanisms</strong> in your pursuit of success. Interact with buttons, gravity boxes, receptacles, doors, jump pads, deflective barriers, moving platforms and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3454540/extras/a9aa0dd674e537fd1f89737bcf753dad.poster.avif?t=1788036856\" aria-label=\"Utilize devices\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3454540/extras/a9aa0dd674e537fd1f89737bcf753dad.webm?t=1788036856\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3454540/extras/a9aa0dd674e537fd1f89737bcf753dad.mp4?t=1788036856\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover <strong>Digiprints and hidden Voicelogs</strong> and try to unravel the mystery of the strange goings on at the facility. Track your discoveries and review your findings in your journal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3454540/extras/1f739c084199564265d8f2e44d1cd715.poster.avif?t=1788036856\" aria-label=\"Discover what happened\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3454540/extras/1f739c084199564265d8f2e44d1cd715.webm?t=1788036856\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3454540/extras/1f739c084199564265d8f2e44d1cd715.mp4?t=1788036856\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve 40+ challenging room-based puzzles that flex your spatial reasoning skills</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Down is not always down - walk along the walls and even the ceiling to achieve your goals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with a variety of devices including buttons, gravity boxes, receptacles, doors, jump pads, deflective barriers and moving platforms</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the AR overlay to gain insight into the layout of the room before tackling it</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover Digiprints and hidden Voicelogs and try to unravel the mystery of the strange goings on at the facility</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take as much time as you want, or try to be fast and compete on the online leaderboards</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Down becomes up - shift your direction of gravity to the walls and ceiling in this first-person 3D puzzle platformer. Solve 40+ challenging room-based puzzles that flex your spatial reasoning skills, rather than precise timing. Compete with others on the leaderboard, or take it slow and steady - the choice is yours.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step on Shift Pads to <strong>change your direction of gravity</strong>, offering a unique way to traverse your environment. Use your newfound freedom to access new areas and interact with the rooms from a truly unique perspective.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3454540/extras/75fabaabe6eee1f3241847bb203ab619.poster.avif?t=1788036856\" aria-label=\"Change gravity\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3454540/extras/75fabaabe6eee1f3241847bb203ab619.webm?t=1788036856\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3454540/extras/75fabaabe6eee1f3241847bb203ab619.mp4?t=1788036856\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enable the <strong>AR overlay</strong> to view device connections and gain valuable insight into the room layout. Use this information to try out different strategies and plan your approach.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3454540/extras/758607869f4498e6f32f7353b4c4f48a.poster.avif?t=1788036856\" aria-label=\"Plan your approach\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3454540/extras/758607869f4498e6f32f7353b4c4f48a.webm?t=1788036856\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3454540/extras/758607869f4498e6f32f7353b4c4f48a.mp4?t=1788036856\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilize a variety of different <strong>devices and mechanisms</strong> in your pursuit of success. Interact with buttons, gravity boxes, receptacles, doors, jump pads, deflective barriers, moving platforms and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3454540/extras/a9aa0dd674e537fd1f89737bcf753dad.poster.avif?t=1788036856\" aria-label=\"Utilize devices\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3454540/extras/a9aa0dd674e537fd1f89737bcf753dad.webm?t=1788036856\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3454540/extras/a9aa0dd674e537fd1f89737bcf753dad.mp4?t=1788036856\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover <strong>Digiprints and hidden Voicelogs</strong> and try to unravel the mystery of the strange goings on at the facility. Track your discoveries and review your findings in your journal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3454540/extras/1f739c084199564265d8f2e44d1cd715.poster.avif?t=1788036856\" aria-label=\"Discover what happened\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3454540/extras/1f739c084199564265d8f2e44d1cd715.webm?t=1788036856\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3454540/extras/1f739c084199564265d8f2e44d1cd715.mp4?t=1788036856\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve 40+ challenging room-based puzzles that flex your spatial reasoning skills</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Down is not always down - walk along the walls and even the ceiling to achieve your goals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with a variety of devices including buttons, gravity boxes, receptacles, doors, jump pads, deflective barriers and moving platforms</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the AR overlay to gain insight into the layout of the room before tackling it</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover Digiprints and hidden Voicelogs and try to unravel the mystery of the strange goings on at the facility</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take as much time as you want, or try to be fast and compete on the online leaderboards</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Down becomes up - shift your direction of gravity to the walls and ceiling in this first-person puzzler. Solve challenging room-based puzzles that flex your spatial reasoning skills, rather than precise timing. Compete with others on the leaderboard, or take it slow and steady - the choice is yours.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3454540/f2a8f99eb6037a878415f6c157d5cc88a6048df5/header.jpg?t=1788036856", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3454540/4152bf2f05ad715cc12f549f4ba998f4de0af9b6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788036856", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3454540/4152bf2f05ad715cc12f549f4ba998f4de0af9b6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788036856", "website": "https://www.whitematter.xyz", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit (1909 or newer)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-6600K or AMD Ryzen 5 1600X<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1060 / AMD RX 580<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storag